                <pb facs="0845" n="759" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg759"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that Mr. Leishman should not treat failure to reply in regard to
                    schools question as a refusal estopping further demands for fulfillment of
                    pledges.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
